 "remarks": "Spacious, clean first floor apartment in building of 6 units. No steps, spacious rooms and lots of natural lighting. Centrally located in a small complex and convenient to everything. Enter into a foyer w/double closets & utility closet, dining area w/plenty of room for table & chairs, a Galley Kitchen with huge pantry and plenty of cabinets, stove, dishwasher & fridge. Large Living Room and Bedroom w/double closets and large enough to accommodate a king sized bed. Laundry area with full size washer & dryer. Full bath w/tub, shower & linen closet. Central air/Off-street reserved parking. Recently painted and carpets professionally cleaned. Must have excellent credit, good references and no pets/smoking.",
